# Written by ev-ground. What is listed here is regenerable or short-lived;
# everything else under .evidence/ is meant to be committed, because it is the
# evidence behind commits that were already made.
#
# Committed on purpose: shapes/  plans/  work/  ship/  learnings/  CONCEPTS.md
# work/ especially: ev-work reads those records to verify a plan's Log before
# resuming, so a clone without them cannot check its own history.

# Regenerated from the tree in seconds. A committed copy goes stale silently
# and is then read as current.
ground.md

# One session's working notes. What is worth keeping gets distilled into
# learnings/ instead.
test-log.md
debug-log.md

# Tied to a base ref that moves; dead once the merge it examined has landed.
reviews/
